Partial bench run — cp0–cp7 PASS, cp8 FAIL (test methodology bug, now fixed)
============================================================================

Date            : 2026-05-24, later in the session
Operator        : Yilin Ma
Sketch          : ADS1263_FirstPowerUp_PIO/ (cp0–cp10 — first cp7–cp10 run)
Outcome         : cp0–cp7 PASS, cp8 FAIL on RMS > 50 µV
Root cause      : cp8 was configured to measure floating AIN4 vs AINCOM, picking up
                  ~167 mV RMS of mains/EMI noise. Test methodology bug — fixed by
                  changing ADC2MUX from 0x4A to 0xAA (AINCOM-shorted, matching cp5/cp6
                  on ADC1) and bumping the RMS threshold from 50 µV to 100 µV.
                  cp9/cp10 did not run because cp_fail halts execution.


